  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Social y Ambiental de los Igaraps de Manaus PROSAMIN</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social and Environmental Program for the Igaraps in Manaus PROSAMIN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Se mantienen los objetivos previstos para la operacin original, BR-L1005: Contribuir a resolver el problema ambiental, urbanstico y social que afecta a la ciudad de Manaus, y en particular a los moradores de la cuenca Educandos-Quarenta en la ciudad de Manaus.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program maintain the same objectives of Loan 1692OC-BR; which are to contribute to the solution of the environmental, urban and social problems that affect the population living in the Igarap Educandos-Quarenta watershed in Manaus.</narrative>
  </description>
